# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# URL scheme: this site's canonical URLs are extensionless. Cloudflare Pages
# resolves /x to x.html natively and 308-redirects /x.html and /x/ to /x, so
# canonicals, sitemap and internal links all use the extensionless form.
#
# Rules below are for legacy WordPress slugs only - paths that have no matching
# file. Each one is written in BOTH forms (no trailing slash and trailing
# slash): Cloudflare treats /foo and /foo/ as different paths, and the
# trailing-slash form used to fall through to the SPA fallback and serve the
# homepage at HTTP 200 (a soft 404). That gap carried 76% of all impressions.
#
# Do NOT add rules whose source is an existing page slug - asset resolution
# runs before _redirects, so such a rule never fires, and its presence stops
# Cloudflare from normalising the trailing-slash variant.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

